# LAMMPS input generated from LammpsInputFile with pymatgen v2025.10.7

units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data interface_gap9.data
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../CuTa.eam.alloy Cu Ta
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo 200
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 2000.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 2000.0 2000.0 0.1
dump 1 all custom 100 traj.lammpstrj id type x y z
dump_modify 1 sort id
run 20000
